OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear spells and a few
OL,7,Fshowers through the evening. Overnight
OL,8,Fsome more frequent and occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy showers spread in from the
OL,10,Fnorthwest, mainly for Argyll. A windy
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBright intervals and rain or
OL,14,Fshowers during the morning, some
OL,15,Fheavy. Turning drier by evening. Fresh
OL,16,Fto strong westerly winds gradually
OL,17,Fease later in the day. On the cool
OL,18,Fside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
